{"version":1,"key":"card:661","content":{"id":661,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"isolation","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性用于控制元素是否应该创建一个新的层叠上下文（stacking context）。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"语法"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"isolation: auto | isolate;","language":"CSS","uuid":"b38b708a-b2a5-4837-9ba9-0c5ce9a28d8e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"auto","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":": 默认值。元素不会显式地创建一个新的层叠上下文，除非其他属性（如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"opacity","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 小于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"）触发了层叠上下文的创建。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"isolate","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":": 元素总是会创建一个新的层叠上下文。这意味着元素的内容会被隔离，外部的混合效果、背景效果等不会渗透到元素内部。"}]}]}]},{"type":"highlight-block","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个应用场景，有一个需要根据视口来定位的元素，但是又希望它的显示范围在其父元素的范围之内，并且符合父元素的层级关系，一般情况下我们会给父元素设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"overflow: hidden","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是我们发现在这种情况单独设置给它的父元素设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"overflow: hidden","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是无效的，因为它的层叠上下文在根元素上，这个时候就可以给父元素设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"ioslation: isolate","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，父元素形成了新的层叠上下文，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"fixed","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 布局的元素就会在这个上下文中，即使到处定位也会被这个层叠上下文限制。"}],"color":"green"}],"tags":["CSS/isolation","CSS/层叠上下文"],"createTime":1767422166275,"updateTime":1775708696894,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1775708696894}}